action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P70: focus moving for a reason the app did not cause.
# expect: log-contains P70 CHECK PASS
#
# Coordinates are origin=frame, read off testapp/output/screenshots/
# p70-macos-final-20260916-085841.png, a 560x588 capture of a 560x560 window --
# so 1x, and the 28px difference is the title bar the frame origin includes.
#
# The whole point is that NOTHING here presses "focus name" or "focus email".
# Every move below is a click on a field, which is the case a `@FocusState`
# written only by the app would get wrong: the caret would move and the property
# would not. The counter is what makes that visible.
#
# P70:焦點因為 app 沒有造成的原因而移動。
#
# 座標為 origin=frame,量自 testapp/output/screenshots/p70-macos-final-20260916-085841.png
# ——一張 560x588 的擷圖,對應一個 560x560 的視窗,因此是 1x;差的 28px 是 frame 原點所含的標題列。
#
# 整件事的重點是:此處**沒有任何一行**去按「focus name」或「focus email」。底下每一次移動都是點在
# 某個欄位上,而那正是「一個只由 app 寫入的 `@FocusState`」會弄錯的情況:游標會動,而那個屬性不會。
# 那個計數器就是讓這件事現形的東西。
# Re-measured 2026-11-24 from p70-macos-final-20261124-125138.png (560x672, the 560x640 window of 37cafb49 with its title bar): name y 263, email y 297, ask both for focus (85, 425). The 560-high coordinates above clicked empty space since then.
# 2026-11-24 依 p70-macos-final-20261124-125138.png 重新量測(560x672,即 37cafb49 的 560x640 視窗加標題列):name y 263、email y 297、ask both for focus (85, 425)。上面以 560 高量的座標自那之後點在空白處。
# After this file: focused field: name, focus changes heard: 3 (AppKit focuses name when the window opens), refusal check: refused (correct).
# 跑完之後:focused field: name、focus changes heard: 3(視窗開啟時 AppKit 讓 name 取得焦點)、refusal check: refused (correct)。
sleep,,,,,,600000,let the window settle and take its own first responder,macos
click,280,297,frame,left,,,click the email field -- the app did not ask for this,macos
sleep,,,,,,500000,,macos
click,280,263,frame,left,,,and back to name,macos
sleep,,,,,,500000,,macos
click,85,425,frame,left,,,ask both for focus -- the disabled button must be refused,macos
sleep,,,,,,700000,let the refusal be reported,macos
